{"id":1705,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>2026年3月19日，QUANSER 鲲航公司负责人王薇应邀来中北大学电气与控制工程学院，在主楼619会议室同自动化系的老师们一起进行了面向未来智能系统的项目式创新教学体系及创新实践平台建设的交流。</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=EMmLebnlMVLNW2oyzAfMRvaozTRM7ChaLzlZMmQVoR-4n7C0gihFp2hmCIa0UYy8LSh7USy8ozCiUzliLmWVMl-4nRLDL8LPUlU4U4M2oRQFU4CsM4vDoRVFMmn2UmUJqjfjo4OeoDX4q1hXptQ0g47aLRN0Lm-4LzlJqd3nx&oid=1127450808&tid=1009&nid=22315&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/C41DA4965A5522E5B3D363C1AD3C3F86/C6777681/64FB4\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=EL8leYL7Q2nmVfLymUsM7QkLRv8o7-hZM7rkMllYnNCYM8L0gihFp2hmCIa0Lkh2LYyaU1y4n7l8L8QfM77ZM7CiUN7bMRWRMRNDL4NPnNVFMNC8nm-DL4rFMRfVMzQVgtXaQ4Oeo4x/vDw0qIbtpYyPLRGbg4-YL47igtA8pU3cc&oid=1127450808&tid=1009&nid=22315&e=.jpg\"></p><p>王薇介绍了Quanser 教学平台的设计理念及开放式科研思维成长型教学方案的构建，并分享了武汉理工大学、北京理工大学、天津大学、上海交通大学、西安交通大学、大连理工大学等高校的工科教学案例。</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=En7Ce4MR62oz7inyRfVUNnRnz-PoRUhiMR-bUN-bLmlPLNl0gihFp2hmCIa0LYh2MSy4LkyYnz6fnRnVMzWkMRNDUmGsM8C8Lm9PMznkozMFnzfVozGbU4nFMz7DoRCJqjfjo4OeoDX4q1hXptQ0g47aLRN0Lm-4LzlJqd3nx&oid=1127450808&tid=1009&nid=22315&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/3F5302E7AD4E52B496B077F428154B93/E0E909C4/51686\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=EUNre7MzARozvaoy7CDMRARnNL8nR6hko7V7nlUDMm9DoRv0gihFp2hmCIa0LSyan1ysUYhRn7WVMR-bUlCYo7-bo7LbMl-snm74o7W7MmnFLmTRUm9aolVFM7Wfo7UDgtXaQ4Oeo4x/vDw0qIbtpYyPLRGbg4-YL47igtA8pU3cc&oid=1127450808&tid=1009&nid=22315&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=EU49eio7-ZMznkMymNDLmUiL77bMlLhYMlWfoRlaMmrkMN70gihFp2hmCIa0MkybUYhkU1ybL49Pn7lYUlQ2nRWVo7VRnlCPLm-PolW7MNnFM7lsMRTfnNMFMRvbU4lJqjfjo4OeoDX4q1hXptQ0g47aLRN0Lm-4LzlJqd3nx&oid=1127450808&tid=1009&nid=22315&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/49CBB9381DE2AFFD2E8ACEF12219BD6D/4E749AFC/479C5\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=EoRLePnN7inNlanyRCsnzTVUlLYollhPMmGsMzUDMmvYM7C0gihFp2hmCIa0LSyPn1hRM1